# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Read only by the server (app/api); never exposed to the browser.
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint: OpenRouter, or a local vLLM / SGLang / llama.cpp / Ollama server on the GB10.
VLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
VLM_API_KEY=
VLM_MODEL=qwen/qwen3-vl-30b-a3b-instruct
# Optional: separate model for the assistant and summary (defaults to VLM_MODEL)
# VLM_CHAT_MODEL=
# Optional: extra request fields as JSON. OpenRouter default: {"reasoning":{"enabled":false},"usage":{"include":true}}
# Local reasoning models, e.g.: {"chat_template_kwargs":{"enable_thinking":false}}
# VLM_EXTRA_BODY=
# Optional: comma-separated models users can pick in Preferences (the server rejects anything else)
# VLM_MODEL_OPTIONS=qwen/qwen3-vl-30b-a3b-instruct,nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning:free,qwen/qwen3.8-27b,google/gemini-2.5-flash,moonshotai/kimi-k2.5,openai/gpt-5.6-sol,google/gemini-3.8-flash
# Optional: local yes/no shoplifting scorer (Qwen3.8-27B + shra012/qwen3.8-27b-ucf-shoplifting-lora) served by
# zrt/vLLM on the GB10. Listed in Preferences as local:<served name>; analyses recorded video only.
# Use a localhost bridge to the vLLM socket (see model/.plans/qwen-lora-zrt.md): zrt's proxy on 8080 only
# routes its service label, not LoRA names.
# LOCAL_SCORER_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1
# LOCAL_SCORER_MODELS=shoplifting-s1,shoplifting-s2,shoplifting-s3
# Optional: local general models that run the same JSON analysis, assistant and summary as OpenRouter models,
# listed as local-vlm:<served name>. Base URL defaults to LOCAL_SCORER_BASE_URL.
# LOCAL_VLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1
# LOCAL_VLM_MODELS=qwen38-shoplifting
# Optional: YOLO person boxes (model/YOLO/src/yolo_server.py). The analysis snaps each incident box to the person
# the model points at and follows them across the window's frames. Without it, boxes are the model's own.
# YOLO_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8090
# Optional: folder of demo clips that Video library > "Load demo clips" copies into the browser.
# Default ../data/demo-clips (12 UCF-Crime clips, git-ignored; copy them to each machine that runs the app).
# DEMO_CLIPS_DIR=../data/demo-clips
